          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We considered different patterns, and explored how to understand them using algebra. We saw that, often, there are multiple ways to solve a problem and arrive at the same correct answer. Finding different methods to approach and solve the same problem is a creative process."
            }
